# Video project — the source and the finished render are tracked; everything
# below is regenerable from SCRIPT.md / STORYBOARD.md and would only bloat the
# repo (voice wavs, a MusicGen bed, site capture, snapshot sheets).
videos/*/assets/voice/
videos/*/assets/bgm/
videos/*/capture/
videos/*/snapshots/
videos/*/.hyperframes/
videos/*/node_modules/
videos/*/.thumbnails/
videos/*/.waveform-cache/
videos/*/audio_engine_meta.json
